commit 81b09b0da46ef827cb110a5f3d66c47441d1f7fd
Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Tue Oct 20 17:43:17 2026 +0200

    feat(tools): validate tool input against inputSchema

    ToolRegistry.execute now compiles each tool's inputSchema with ajv and
    validates model-supplied input before the executor runs. A rejected call
    returns a ToolResponse naming the failing property path and the failed
    constraint - never a property value - so the model can correct the call
    within the existing tool-round budget, and a static tool's schema is
    compiled once at register time so a broken schema fails at startup.
    Function-valued sources resolve per call, cached by schema object.

    re-cinq/HALEngine#37

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

